# Declarative Go packages to install via 'go install' during build.
# Format: <package@version> [ENV_VARS]
# One package per line. Empty lines and lines starting with # are ignored.

# Example: install dasel (JSON/YAML/TOML query tool) at specific version
# github.com/tomwright/dasel/v2/cmd/dasel@v2.8.0

# Example: install yq (YAML processor) at latest version
# github.com/mikefarah/yq/v4@latest

# Example: install with custom build tags / CGO flags
# github.com/example/tool@v1.2.3 CGO_ENABLED=1 GOFLAGS="-tags=netgo"

# Example: install delta (diff viewer) at latest
# github.com/dandavison/delta@latest